  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0119_7855bd31dd69.png\" style=\"width: 311px; height: 298px;\" /><br />Equation of family of circles touches line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at point <math><mo>(</mo><mn>1,1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />If a member of this family, also passes through point <math><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> then<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> Required circle is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Where radius is <math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>"
  }
